---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About Plant Identifier"
  description="Why Plant Identifier exists and how we approach free, honest plant identification by photo."
  canonicalPath="/about/"
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">About us</p><h1>
        A small tool for bigger curiosity.
      </h1><p class="hero-lede" style="margin-left:0">
        Plant Identifier helps people put a likely name to the plants around
        them without an app install, account or paywall.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section-tight">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>Why we built it</h2><p>
        When someone searches for a plant identifier, they usually have a photo
        and one immediate question. We designed the site to answer that question
        in the browser, then make uncertainty visible rather than pretending an
        image model is always right.
      </p><h2>How identification works</h2><p>
        Your selected photos are resized in your browser and sent through our
        secure endpoint to a specialist botanical identification provider. We
        return a short, normalized list of likely matches and confidence scores.
        We do not create public result URLs from uploads.
      </p><h2>What we will not claim</h2><p>
        Plant identification from an image is useful, but it is not expert
        verification. The site should never be the only source used for
        decisions about eating, medicine, toxicity or pet safety.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
